!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/meta-route-annotation.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/meta.tn"
@meta.doc:"""
  A meta layer declaring an annotation whose value is an identifier-keyed map. A schema importing this one
  writes `@routes` on its declarations, and the map's keys are names ([TSON-DATA] §8.2): a value of an
  identifier family is a name wherever it stands, a schema's annotation values included, and the keys of
  one map are one naming scope.
  """
!schema {
  method_name => meta.identifier
  routes      => @meta.annotation {method_name => meta.text}
}
